      "text": "#EXCLUSIVE DHS says an illegal immigrant from Mexico charged with attempted rape and sexual misconduct of a child in Indiana now has an ice detainer lodged against him. \n\nThe charges against Javier Cereque-Perez stem from an incident in 2024 where an underaged victim told officers he touched her inappropriately, tried to take her clothes off and attempted to rape her in a vehicle. \n\nCereque-Perez was arrested during a joint operation with the FBI in Indianapolis. He was turned over to local police to face the charges—Which include two counts of attempting to commit rape, sexual misconduct with a minor and sexual battery.  \n\nDHS says Cereque-Perez entered the U.S. illegally at an unknown date and location.",
      "text_resolved": "#EXCLUSIVE DHS says an illegal immigrant from Mexico charged with attempted rape and sexual misconduct of a child in Indiana now has an ice detainer lodged against him. \n\nThe charges against Javier Cereque-Perez stem from an incident in 2024 where an underaged victim told officers he touched her inappropriately, tried to take her clothes off and attempted to rape her in a vehicle. \n\nCereque-Perez was arrested during a joint operation with the FBI in Indianapolis. He was turned over to local police to face the charges—Which include two counts of attempting to commit rape, sexual misconduct with a minor and sexual battery.  \n\nDHS says Cereque-Perez entered the U.S. illegally at an unknown date and location.",
